## 3. Contrat de donnees

### Source interne: `ArticleDraft`

Chemin actuel acceptable: `articles/<id>.article.json`.

Schema cible:

```json
{
  "schema": "article.draft.v1",
  "id": "a...",
  "title": "Titre",
  "subtitle": "",
  "slug": "mon-article",
  "status": "draft",
  "language": "fr",
  "theme": "white",
  "font": "serif",
  "size": 17,
  "ratio": "free",
  "sourceNodePath": "pages/Projects/My Draft.md",
  "blocks": [],
  "mediaRefs": [
    {
      "id": "hero",
      "role": "hero",
      "nodePath": "pages/References/image.img.json",
      "alt": "Alt text",
      "caption": ""
    }
  ],
  "relatedProjects": [
    {
      "id": 34,
      "slug": "hda-stairs-component",
      "title": "HDA Stairs Component",
      "url": "https://matthieuhuguet.com/reels/hda-stairs-component"
    }
